WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:07.400
I can remember Daddy [Leo Stanley Butler] would get grumpy during tax time; we had to pay income tax and tax to the city.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.840
And why is it, if he was paying tax, [we] could not go to swim in that pool?

3
00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.860
And rather than have us integrate that pool, they closed it.
